.TH CCNGET "1" "2026\-08\-18" "ccnget 0.1.7" "Generated Python Manual"
.SH NAME
ccnget
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ccnget
[-h] [--loglevel LOGLEVEL] [-v] {lookup,retrieve,fetch,config,extent} ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
lookup urls and get files from Common Crawl News

.SH
POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fBccnget\fR \fI\,lookup\/\fR
Lookup URLs in CC\-NEWS index
.TP
\fBccnget\fR \fI\,retrieve\/\fR
Retrieve WARC records from Common Crawl
.TP
\fBccnget\fR \fI\,fetch\/\fR
Lookup and retrieve the first result
.TP
\fBccnget\fR \fI\,config\/\fR
Manage persistent settings
.TP
\fBccnget\fR \fI\,extent\/\fR
Show what content is indexed on the server

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget lookup'\/\fR
usage: ccnget lookup [\-h] [\-\-exact] [\-\-at AT] [\-\-limit LIMIT] url

.TP
\fBurl\fR

.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'ccnget lookup'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-exact\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI\,AT\/\fR
Timestamp (YYYYMMDDhhmmss). Seeks from timestamp if exact=True, finds closest
match if exact=False.

.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI\,LIMIT\/\fR
Limit value (1\-100, default: 10)

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget retrieve'\/\fR
usage: ccnget retrieve [\-h] \-\-warc\-path WARC_PATH \-\-offset OFFSET
                       \-\-length LENGTH [\-\-output OUTPUT]

.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'ccnget retrieve'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-warc\-path\fR \fI\,WARC_PATH\/\fR
WARC path from lookup results

.TP
\fB\-\-offset\fR \fI\,OFFSET\/\fR
Byte offset in WARC file

.TP
\fB\-\-length\fR \fI\,LENGTH\/\fR
Byte length of record

.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI\,OUTPUT\/\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fI\,OUTPUT\/\fR
Output file path (default: stdout)

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget fetch'\/\fR
usage: ccnget fetch [\-h] [\-\-exact] [\-\-at AT] [\-\-output OUTPUT] url

.TP
\fBurl\fR

.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'ccnget fetch'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-exact\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI\,AT\/\fR
Timestamp (YYYYMMDDhhmmss). Seeks from timestamp if exact=True, finds closest
match if exact=False.

.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI\,OUTPUT\/\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fI\,OUTPUT\/\fR
Output file path (default: stdout)

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget config'\/\fR
usage: ccnget config [\-h] {set,get,show,unset} ...

.SH
POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS \fI\,'ccnget config'\/\fR
.TP
\fBccnget config\fR \fI\,set\/\fR
Set a config value
.TP
\fBccnget config\fR \fI\,get\/\fR
Get a config value
.TP
\fBccnget config\fR \fI\,show\/\fR
Show all config values and sources
.TP
\fBccnget config\fR \fI\,unset\/\fR
Remove a config value

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget config set'\/\fR
usage: ccnget config set [\-h] {cdx\-url,cc\-crawl\-base\-url} value

.TP
\fB{cdx\-url,cc\-crawl\-base\-url}\fR

.TP
\fBvalue\fR

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget config get'\/\fR
usage: ccnget config get [\-h] {cdx\-url,cc\-crawl\-base\-url}

.TP
\fB{cdx\-url,cc\-crawl\-base\-url}\fR

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget config show'\/\fR
usage: ccnget config show [\-h]

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget config unset'\/\fR
usage: ccnget config unset [\-h] {cdx\-url,cc\-crawl\-base\-url}

.TP
\fB{cdx\-url,cc\-crawl\-base\-url}\fR

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'ccnget extent'\/\fR
usage: ccnget extent [\-h]

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-loglevel\fR \fI\,LOGLEVEL\/\fR
CRITICAL ERROR WARNING INFO DEBUG NOTSET, default is WARNING

.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.BI CDX_URL
The base URL for the CDX index server. 
Default: \fIhttps://brian-learns-cc-news-cdx-server.hf.space/\fR
.TP
.BI CC_CRAWL_BASE_URL
The base URL for downloading Common Crawl data. 
Default: \fIhttps://data.commoncrawl.org\fR
.PP
These variables can be set directly in your shell environment or defined in a local \fI.env\fR file.
